	(text "Notes:\n1) Signal chain: J7 sensor → comparator with hysteresis → missing-pulse \n   detector (U31/Q10), whose timeout R43 adjusts → U29 ÷8 → sequencer.\n2) U32 holds the sequencer off while the motor spins up.\n3) Idle timer U34: the motor turns off about 2.4s after the last character. \n   C33 must be a low-leakage part; use film if replaced."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
